      "patch": "@@ -1,14 +1,14 @@\n name: CI\n \n-# push covers the actual default branch (this repository's default is the\n-# long-lived claude/arq-cad-platform-research-ba8rav branch, not main);\n-# merge_group is present so a merge queue can be enabled later without a\n-# coverage gap \u2014 see engineering/33_IMPLEMENTATION_HANDOFF.md Phase 2.\n+# Push covers both the current canonical branch and the stable branch candidate\n+# during the non-destructive default-branch cutover tracked by #332. Keep both\n+# until the new default has exact-head CI/Pages proof and the rollback window\n+# is complete; pull_request and merge_group remain branch-name independent.\n on:\n   pull_request:\n   merge_group:\n   push:\n-    branches: [claude/arq-cad-platform-research-ba8rav]\n+    branches: [claude/arq-cad-platform-research-ba8rav, main]\n \n # This is the expensive workflow - eleven headless-Chromium capability checks,\n # the full test suite and the language ladder - and without a concurrency group"
    },
