      "patch": "@@ -8,9 +8,10 @@\n # SITE_ORIGIN enables sitemap.xml, the robots Sitemap line and absolute\n # Open Graph URLs.\n #\n-# Triggers: pushes that touch the site on the default branch, plus manual\n-# dispatch. (The in-flight site branch triggers were trimmed after PRs #282\n-# and #283 merged, as their own comments instructed.)\n+# Triggers: pushes that touch the site on either the current canonical branch\n+# or the stable branch candidate during the non-destructive #332 cutover, plus\n+# manual dispatch. Keep both branches until the new default has live Pages\n+# proof and the rollback window is complete.\n #\n # Language System 4.1 adds three gates around the existing build: route\n # coverage before the build, a rendered-copy audit that writes a commit-bound\n@@ -25,6 +26,7 @@ on:\n   push:\n     branches:\n       - claude/arq-cad-platform-research-ba8rav\n+      - main\n     paths:\n       - 'apps/marketing/**'\n       - 'brand/**'"
